    "title": "Traditional Leadership: Chieftaincy, Queenmothers, Symbols of Authority & Customary Arbitration",
    "description": "Analyze the moral authority of Ghanaian traditional leadership: the institution of chieftaincy, queenmothers, criteria for enstoolment/enskinment, symbols of authority (stools/skins, linguist staff), and palace conflict resolution.",
